          <p class="text-gray-300 leading-relaxed mb-4">
            The Champion 201319 is the best dual fuel inverter generator for most people: 3,150 running watts on propane, a 61 dBA rating at 23 feet, CO Shield and a 30-amp RV outlet at 99.2 lb. Pick the Generac iQ5200DF or Westinghouse iGen5000DF for 3,500 propane watts, and the Champion 201417 or Westinghouse iGen12000TFc if you need 240V for a transfer switch.
          </p>
          <p class="text-gray-300 leading-relaxed mb-4">
